entries.answer:
According to the policy document excerpts, the per-item limit for a laptop or other personal computer is $3,000. This is stated in both [Source 1] and [Source 2] as part of the Individual item sub-limits:

- $3,000 for personal computers, tablets, cameras or video cameras;

Additionally, [Source 3] also confirms this limit under the Increased Item Limits Cover:

$3,000 for personal computers, tablets, cameras or video cameras;

Source: ALLIANZ_20251219.pdf, page 12 and 20

